  "onboardingWelcomePopupTitle": "Thanks for installing\nShiftbell",
  "onboardingWelcomePopupBody": "Set up your shift schedule and alarms just once, and alarms will ring automatically at the right time for your shift.\n\n📅  See your shifts by date on the calendar\n🗓️  Manage schedule items and their notifications\n👥  Share your schedule with friends",
  "onboardingWelcomePopupStartButton": "Get Started",
  "onboardingShiftAssignPopupTitle": "Here's how to assign shifts",
  "onboardingShiftAssignPopupBody": "Irregular shifts don't follow a set pattern, so you need to assign a shift to each date yourself.\n\nLong-press a date to enter selection mode, tap through the dates you want, then tap a shift name at the bottom to assign it.\n\nYou can change an assigned shift the same way at any time.",
  "onboardingScheduleTabPopupTitle": "Here's how to use the Schedule tab",
  "onboardingScheduleTabPopupBody": "1. Create a schedule item\nTap the clock icon in the bottom right to switch to a mode where you pick a time on the timeline. Tap again at the time you want to create a new schedule item there.\n\n2. Set a duration\nBy default, an item has \"No duration\" (a single point in time). Tap \"+\" or the 5 min/30 min/1 hr buttons to give it an end time.\n\n3. Get notified for a schedule item\nTurn on the switch to get a light notification right at the time, or 5/10/30 minutes before. This is separate from an \"alarm\" (lock screen/ringtone) — it follows your system notification settings.\n\n4. Past times\nSchedule items you created at a time that has already passed are marked with an exclamation (⚠) icon.",
